        // The property is: after a failed withdrawal (where the external call reverts), the contract reverts,
        // which implies credit and balance remain unchanged.
        // So the assertion is that after the reverting call, credit persists.
        // But we already asserted inside catch. The test must end with exactly one assertTrue.
